---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="drawer-scrim" data-quote-scrim></div>
<aside class="drawer" data-quote-drawer role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="teklif-baslik" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="drawer__head">
    <div class="drawer__title">
      <span class="drawer__badge" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="list" /></span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="teklif-baslik">Teklif Sepeti</h2>
        <p class="drawer__sum" data-quote-sum>Fiyat sorma listesi</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="drawer__close" type="button" data-quote-close aria-label="Kapat"><Icon name="close" /></button>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer__body">
    <div class="drawer__empty" data-quote-empty>
      <span class="drawer__empty-ico" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="list" /></span>
      <b>Sepetiniz boş</b>
      <p>Katalogdan kodu seçip adedi girin. Liste tek mesaj olarak WhatsApp’tan gider.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--sm btn--tin" href="/urunler">Kataloğa git <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="qlist" data-quote-list></ul>
    <div class="drawer__fields" data-quote-fields hidden>
      <fieldset class="qsec">
        <legend class="qsec__h"><span class="qsec__n">1</span>Teslim şekli</legend>
        <div class="qcards" data-q-teslim>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-teslim" value="Adrese teslim" checked /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="truck" /><b>Adrese teslim</b><small>Atölyeye getiririz</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-teslim" value="Kargo" /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="box" /><b>Kargo</b><small>Kargoyla gönderelim</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-teslim" value="Ostim'den gelip alırım" /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="store" /><b>Gelip alırım</b><small>Ostim’den teslim</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="qsec">
        <legend class="qsec__h"><span class="qsec__n">2</span>Ne zaman lazım?</legend>
        <div class="qcards" data-q-termin>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-termin" value="Acil (bugün / yarın)" /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="bolt" /><b>Acil</b><small>Bugün ya da yarın</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-termin" value="Bu hafta" /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="calendar" /><b>Bu hafta</b><small>Birkaç gün içinde</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
          <label class="qcard"><input type="radio" name="q-termin" value="" checked /><span class="qcard__box"><Icon name="clock" /><b>Fark etmez</b><small>Termine göre</small><i class="qcard__tick"><Icon name="check" /></i></span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="qsec">
        <p class="qsec__h"><span class="qsec__n">3</span>Konum <em>isteğe bağlı</em></p>
        <div class="qloc" data-q-loc>
          <button class="qloc__btn" type="button" data-q-loc-btn>
            <span class="qloc__ico"><Icon name="pin" /></span>
            <span><b>Konumumu ekle</b><small>Nereye geleceğimizi mesajda görelim</small></span>
            <Icon name="plus" class="qloc__plus" />
          </button>
          <div class="qloc__card" data-q-loc-card hidden>
            <div class="qloc__map" data-q-loc-map></div>
            <div class="qloc__info">
              <b data-q-loc-place>Konum alındı</b>
              <small data-q-loc-meta></small>
              <div class="qloc__actions">
                <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-q-loc-open>Haritada aç</a>
                <button type="button" data-q-loc-clear>Kaldır</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="qloc__msg" data-q-loc-msg role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="qsec">
        <p class="qsec__h"><span class="qsec__n">4</span>Firma ve not <em>isteğe bağlı</em></p>
        <div class="qinput">
          <label for="q-firma"><Icon name="building" /><span class="sr-only">Firma ya da ad</span></label>
          <input id="q-firma" name="firma" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Firma ya da adınız" />
        </div>
        <div class="qinput qinput--area">
          <label for="q-not"><Icon name="note" /><span class="sr-only">Not</span></label>
          <textarea id="q-not" name="not" rows="3" placeholder="Malzeme, tezgâh ya da adres tarifi. Örn. 42CrMo4 mil, kaba torna; 2. kat, Ahmet Bey."></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer__foot" data-quote-foot hidden>
    <a class="btn btn--wa btn--block drawer__send" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-quote-send><Icon name="whatsapp" /> WhatsApp’tan teklif iste</a>
    <div class="drawer__pair">
      <button class="drawer__alt" type="button" data-quote-copy><Icon name="copy" /> Metni kopyala</button>
      <button class="drawer__alt" type="button" data-quote-share title="Aynı listeyi satın almaya ya da bir arkadaşınıza bağlantı olarak gönderin"><Icon name="share" /> Listeyi paylaş</button>
    </div>
    <p class="drawer__legal">Bu bir sipariş değil. Mesaj WhatsApp’ta açılır, göndermeden önce değiştirebilirsiniz. Konum dahil hiçbir bilgiyi kaydetmiyoruz. <a href="/kvkk">KVKK aydınlatma metni</a></p>
  </div>
</aside>
